00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.160
Right.

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:14.300
And this is really the kind of big divide
that we're seeing in politics at the moment,

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:18.900
I think explains a lot of the age divide and
