00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:31.410
Right.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.410
People are better able to get mortgages.

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.020
They could purchase homes in the UK.

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:40.380
You had mass sell off of formerly publicly
owned housing and it created this class of

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:44.360
homeowners who were able to take advantage
of that massive increase in house prices that

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:49.839
we've seen over the last 50 years become very
wealthy and as a result, become very conservative.

00:08:49.839 --> 00:08:53.120
Because if you're on the verge of retirement
or you're already retired, you have a lot

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.120
of wealth stored up in your home.

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:55.120
You have a lot of wealth stored up in your
pension.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.600
What do you want?

00:08:56.600 --> 00:09:00.370
The main thing that you want is to see house
