00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:11.950
Certainly with house prices like you are probably
struggling to get on the on the on the housing

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:15.930
ladder, maybe struggling to get a mortgage,
maybe you don't have, like, a full time job.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:20.430
The is the kind of job that will allow you
to get a mortgage, maybe you like self-employed

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:21.630
or precariously employed.

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:25.130
So you're really struggling often to get on
the housing ladder, especially if you're looking

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:26.950
at one of these big cities.

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:31.190
And that is often you're also paying extremely
high rents in the private rented sector.

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.190
Right.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.670
And, you know, parts of London, people are
