00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:49.920
to stay the same, and who are as a result,
becoming quite conservative out of this desire

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:54.450
to hold on to the kind of gains that they've
made versus everyone else who's being shut

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:58.450
out of that system is, I think, probably the
most important divide in politics at the moment.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:02.150
Speaker 1: So so in a sense, it's sort of
a political football in the sense that you

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:07.690
can argue that housing prices being up is
