00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:55.690
wealth spectrum is not sustainable.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:11:02.230
Speaker 1: Last thing I want to talk about
is in the United States, Republicans for decades

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:07.330
now have been saying this government spending
